{"id":"4339a848b5e63fc1","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-modal-abstract-translation.md","title":"Modal Translations into an Abstract Provability System","display":"df-modal-abstract-translation — Modal Translations into an Abstract Provability System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-modal-abstract-translation","aliases":["92-df-modal-abstract-translation"],"display":"df-modal-abstract-translation — Modal Translations into an Abstract Provability System","source":"第 XI 章 p. 133（PDF 150）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-modal-language]]","[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-modal-abstract-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-modal-abstract-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-abstract-translation — Modal Translations into an Abstract Provability System"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 133（PDF 150）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c908091e8e31a3b\" href=\"?note=4c908091e8e31a3b\" title=\"92-df-modal-language\">92-df-modal-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7c85c79ae7f29681\" href=\"?note=7c85c79ae7f29681\" title=\"92-df-abstract-provability-system\">92-df-abstract-provability-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7c85c79ae7f29681\" href=\"?note=7c85c79ae7f29681\" title=\"92-df-abstract-provability-system\">92-df-abstract-provability-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to S\">\\(\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to S\\)</span> 是任意赋值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^M_\\rho\">\\(\\tau^M_\\rho\\)</span> 为以下递归扩张。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^M_\\rho&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to S,\\\\\n\\tau^M_\\rho(p_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(p_i),&amp;\\tau^M_\\rho(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq f,\\\\\n\\tau^M_\\rho(F\\supset H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau^M_\\rho(F)\\Rightarrow\\tau^M_\\rho(H),&amp;\n\\tau^M_\\rho(\\Box F)&amp;\\coloneqq B(\\tau^M_\\rho(F)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^M_\\rho&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to S,\\\\\n\\tau^M_\\rho(p_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(p_i),&amp;\\tau^M_\\rho(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq f,\\\\\n\\tau^M_\\rho(F\\supset H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau^M_\\rho(F)\\Rightarrow\\tau^M_\\rho(H),&amp;\n\\tau^M_\\rho(\\Box F)&amp;\\coloneqq B(\\tau^M_\\rho(F)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在性由有限公式树递归，唯一性由树结构归纳。B 作用于 M 的元素，不接收自然数码，除非 M 专门由算术系统构成。</p>\n<p>没有把命题变量当作一阶数变量，也没有在对象语言中量化所有翻译。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-modal-language","status":"resolved","id":"4c908091e8e31a3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-abstract-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"7c85c79ae7f29681","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-abstract-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"7c85c79ae7f29681","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)$ 满足 $\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)$，见 [[92-df-abstract-provability-system]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau^M_\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^M_\\rho&:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to S,\\\\\n\\tau^M_\\rho(p_i)&\\coloneqq\\rho(p_i),&\\tau^M_\\rho(\\bot)&\\coloneqq f,\\\\\n\\tau^M_\\rho(F\\supset H)&\\coloneqq\\tau^M_\\rho(F)\\Rightarrow\\tau^M_\\rho(H),&\n\\tau^M_\\rho(\\Box F)&\\coloneqq B(\\tau^M_\\rho(F)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1359,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-abstract-translation]] → [[92-thm-modal-translation-soundness]]；[[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness]]。"},{"id":"26dafbc0a373cac4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-abstract-translation]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-abstract-translation]]"}],"outgoing":["4c908091e8e31a3b","7c85c79ae7f29681"]}